    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Sample Descriptive Statistics\"\nformat: html\n---\n\n\nIn this file, we'll import all of the Virginia DJJ files provided and create preliminary cross-tabulations and merges to explore basic counts, trends, and double check primary keys and joins across the data files. \n\nSee `Codebooks` and `Data Diagram` tabs for more information on each individual data file. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n# Sample Descriptives\n\n**Data Sample:** \n\n* Juvenile intake complaints with intake dates from July 1, 2015 - June 30, 2021\n\n* Dispositions – all dispositions for the intake complaints in the sample. \n\n* Caseload – all intake complaints in the sample that are associated with a workload status for diversion - \"Diversion At Intake\" or \"Diversion Program Beyond 90 Days\"\n\n\n\n## Table 1. Unique Youth and Complaints by Year (Year of Complaint)\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-condensed table-responsive\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Year of Complaint </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Youth (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Complaints (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Complaints, Percent of Sample (%) </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2015 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 14,520 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 19,549 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 9.8% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2016 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 26,018 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 39,575 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 19.8% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2017 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 26,227 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 39,397 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 19.7% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2018 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 24,030 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 35,385 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 17.7% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2019 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 23,793 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 34,842 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 17.5% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2020 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 14,978 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 21,402 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 10.7% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2021 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 7,401 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 9,501 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 4.8% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> Overall </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 99,224 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 199,651 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 100.0% </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n<br>\n\n## Table 2: Unique Youth and Complaints by Race/Ethnicity\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-condensed table-responsive\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Race/Ethnicity </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Youth (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Youth, Percent of Sample (%) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Complaints (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Complaints, Percent of Sample (%) </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> American Indian </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 115 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 0.1% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 197 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 0.1% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Asian </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,239 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1.2% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,949 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1.0% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Black </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 35,020 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 35.3% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 81,971 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 41.1% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Hispanic </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 9,447 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 9.5% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 21,495 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 10.8% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> White </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 44,022 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 44.4% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 80,498 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 40.3% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Other </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 8,145 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 8.2% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 12,135 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 6.1% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Missing </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,236 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1.2% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,406 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 0.7% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> Overall </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 99,224 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 100.0% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 199,651 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 100.0% </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n<br>\n",
